WEBVTT

00:33:29.413 --> 00:33:36.121
taking pleasure in the ideas of your
collaborator seemed to be very useful,

00:33:36.371 --> 00:33:37.788
and I've been lucky that way.

00:33:38.454 --> 00:33:40.579
On that note, almost anyone
who's ever won

00:33:40.579 --> 00:33:44.579
a Nobel Prize has complained
that it hurt their career.

00:33:45.496 --> 00:33:48.788
And I've wondered what the experience
has been like for you

00:33:49.121 --> 00:33:52.496
or I mean, it hurts people's
career if they're young.

00:33:52.621 --> 00:33:58.121
You know, I got mine when I was 68,
and for me it was a net loss.

00:33:58.371 --> 00:34:00.829
Why does it get people in trouble
if they get it earlier?